# Chart multi-period (ADR 0005)

Maintained chart surfaces: **个股走势** + **布林编排命中详情**. Shared `chartPeriod`: `daily` | `weekly` | `monthly`.

- Aggregate from `daily_bars` at read time; no weekly/monthly tables.
- `lookback` = bar count of the **current** period; remember per period (defaults 60 / 104 / 60).
- Natural week + natural month; include incomplete current bar; label = last trading day in bucket.
- Compute BOLL/MACD/KDJ on the aggregated series with the same params; warm up then truncate.
- Events / edge hit markers: **daily only**.
- Zone verification bar: **all periods** (daily from `stock_state_daily`; weekly/monthly computed on read, not persisted). Pattern edges remain daily-only.

API: `/api/stocks/{symbol}/bars?period=...&lookback_bars=...` (keep `lookback_days` as alias for bar count on this endpoint).
Optional `forward_bars`: after `end_date`, attach up to N more bars of the same period (布林命中详情默认 500，实际有多少拉多少直到库内最新；已是最新则 0).
